From: openRuyi Project Contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Allow NumPy 2.4 for the system Python
Upstream: https://github.com/candle-org/MindAct
Upstream-Status: Pending

The openRuyi Python 3.14 stack uses NumPy 2.4. Include that minor
version in the tested range for the core package.

--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -32,3 +32,3 @@
 dependencies = [
-    "numpy>=2.0,<2.3",
+    "numpy>=2.0,<2.5",
     "pyyaml>=6.0",
